OL,4,CBurnham rejects calls for devolution   
OL,5,Cof powers in letter to Welsh FM        
OL,6,GThe prime minister has rejected long-  
OL,7,Gstanding calls from the first minister 
OL,8,Gof Wales for certain powers to be      
OL,9,Gtransferred from Westminster to        
OL,10,GCardiff.                               
OL,12,FIn a letter to Rhun ap Iorwerth, Andy  
OL,13,FBurnham said he was "not persuaded" by 
OL,14,Fthe case to devolve responsibilities   
OL,15,Fover policing and justice, the Crown   
OL,16,FEstate and rail infrastructure to      
OL,17,FWales.                                 
OL,19,FThe first minister accused the prime   
OL,20,Fminister of "turning his back on       
OL,21,Fdevolution" and not viewing Wales as   
OL,22,Fan "equal nation".                G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
