OL,4,CCatherine Zeta-Jones' daughter says    
OL,5,Cparents warned her about 'nepo baby'   
OL,6,Clabel                                  
OL,7,GCatherine Zeta-Jones's daughter has    
OL,8,Gsaid her parents warned her people     
OL,9,Gmight have "preconceived notions"      
OL,10,Gabout her embarking on an acting       
OL,11,Gcareer, as she shared her views on the 
OL,12,G"nepo baby" label.                     
OL,14,FCarys Douglas, 23, made her stage      
OL,15,Fdebut this year, playing the lead role 
OL,16,Fof Nina in Anton Chekhov's The Seagull 
OL,17,Fin Brooklyn, New York.                 
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
